      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Patients with arthrogryposis often require anesthesia for surgical procedures. Intubation can be challenging due to lack of visualization. Anesthetic maintenance is fairly routine. Pheripheral blocks are an important adjunct to postoperative pain management."},
